      "objclass": "StarChallengeBeatTheLevelProps",
      "objdata": {
        "DescriptionsMultilanguage": [
          {
            "en": "Calm down and enjoy the music thoroughly. Do nothing else",
            "zh": "静下心来，好好欣赏音乐，什么都不要做"
          },
          {
            "en": "Please don't press the acceleration button",
            "zh": "请不要按下加速按钮"
          }
        ]
      }
        },
        {
            "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
            "aliases": [
                "KONGFU_44_INTRO"
            ],
            "objdata": {
                "Flow": [
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Good evening, my dear neighbor.",
                            "zh": "晚上好，我亲爱的邻居。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Let me introduce the current situation.",
                            "zh": "我来介绍一下今天的情况。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "There won't be any danger tonight.",
                            "zh": "今天晚上不会有任何危机。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Because the zombies said they were going to hold a music and film festival in your front yard.",
                            "zh": "因为僵尸们要在你的前院开一场音乐放映会。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "I invited an explosives expert.",
                            "zh": "我邀请了一位爆破工。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "He will be responsible for dealing with the least useful things.",
                            "zh": "他会负责处理最没用的东西。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Oh, by the way, there will also be an unwilling flag-waving guy coming here.",
                            "zh": "哦对了，还有一位不情愿的摇旗小哥会来这里。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "He was assigned by the organizers to come here and wave the flag.",
                            "zh": "他被放映会主办方指派来这里摇旗。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Although he was reluctant, he said that his superiors had instructed him that after raising this flag, he would be granted an all-leather flag. So, he finally came.",
                            "zh": "他虽然很不情愿，但上头说他举完这次旗帜后就能拥有一面纯皮旗帜，于是他来了。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Apart from the two of them, no one else will come here.",
                            "zh": "除了他们两位，不会有人来到这里了。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "However, there is a group of punk guys who insist on coming here to enjoy the music.",
                            "zh": "不过有一群朋克小伙，他们也坚持要来这里欣赏音乐。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "They said this piece of music was the entirety of their lives. They even skipped putting on makeup in order to catch the screening.",
                            "zh": "他们说这首音乐就是他们生命的全部，为了赶上放映会连妆都没化。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Although I think their noise might disturb the audience.",
                            "zh": "虽然我觉得他们发出的声音可能会影响听众。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "But their expressions were very sincere and their tone was almost pleading, so I let them in.",
                            "zh": "但是他们的样子非常真诚，言语近乎恳求，所以我就放他们进来了。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Enjoy it.",
                            "zh": "享受音乐吧。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "NPC_EXIT"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "No tallnuts in this level were harmed.",
                            "zh": "本关没有任何一株高坚果受到伤害。"
                        }
                    }
                ]
      }
